        "original_id": "13c1dd68-2659-5ff9-8e2f-3cdaa24e2800",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt McKenzie, Ian McKellen, Colin Clive\n- TV Shows: That '70s Show, JAG, 7th Heaven, The O.C., 24\n- Films: Gods and Monsters\n- Places: Point Place, Wisconsin\n- Topics: guest appearances, television setting\n\nFacts:\n- Matt McKenzie guest starred in the film Gods and Monsters with Sir Ian McKellen and portrayed Colin Clive in that film.\n- Matt McKenzie also guest starred in the TV shows JAG, 7th Heaven, That '70s Show, The O.C., and 24, where he played Agent Hollister.\n- That '70s Show focused on a group of teenage friends living in the fictional suburban town of Point Place, Wisconsin.\n- That '70s Show was set from May 17, 1976, to December 31, 1979.",
